/home/sat/mcrl-hub/.scratch/multi-catfish-v023-c3s-v1-chatgpt-package-20260908/package-r5/15-GEMINI-REDTEAM.md:80:   Terrestrial load balancing spreads users across cells to reduce congestion. In satellite EE where PA fixed power dominates, spreading users increases power by activating more beams. Maximum EE requires *load consolidation* (packing users into minimal beams and evacuating the rest). Framing C3 as "load balancing" pointed the architecture in the wrong direction.
