/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-SUNI-OFFLINE-ARM-2026-09-10.md:21:## A vacuous test also closed
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-FINDING-SUNI-OFFLINE-ARM-2026-09-10.md:22:The T2 acceptance test previously passed on a case where the interaction was zero and both arms selected the base profile — it could not fail. It now requires three conditions together: the placebo interaction within its existing tolerance, the unilateral arm selecting a non-anchor profile, and the deployed selector selecting that same profile. The current degenerate case now fails with "T2 is vacuous: the unilateral arm must select a non-anchor profile". No tolerance or threshold was changed; only the conjunction was strengthened.
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-DECISIONS-PIPELINE-AUDITS-CD-2026-09-08.md:5:1. **Temporal event ledger (C1, D-N6; ENGINE):** at a matched anchor the "before" state of every arm is the anchor's incumbent association (the carrier's committed physical assignment at t − 1), never the same-step BASE proposal; events are classified by physical identity (stay / beam change / satellite change / re-entry / cell re-key from the dwell boundary); Φ, handover counts and interruption blackouts derive from those events; in closed-loop evaluation the ledger follows each arm's own trajectory. KAT: three-step fixture with all five event kinds.
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-DECISIONS-PIPELINE-AUDITS-CD-2026-09-08.md:12:8. **Live legality within the step (D-N4; ENGINE):** a link that crosses below 10° or loses D2 eligibility at boundary k stops radiating and decoding from boundary k onward (energy and bits stop; the user is unserved for the remainder); KAT with D2 release and 10° crossing at boundary 17.
/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-DECISIONS-PIPELINE-AUDITS-CD-2026-09-08.md:13:9. **C2 forecasts (D-N8; ENGINE):** forecasts use nominal geometry and nominal interference only (no realised fading), survival is the focal user's, an INVALID solve makes the forecast INVALID (no surrogate), the uncapped required-power margin is reported even when negative. KATs for each.
