/home/sat/mcrl-records/decisions/V025-CONTROLLER-ADJUDICATION-MARGIN-CLOSED-2026-09-09.md:28:* **The mode-selection bug does not exist.** Both the scalar and the batch selection paths maximise efficiency. I had already verified the scalar path; the batch path is confirmed too. **Closed.**
