- **#14 C2 clean-room C3 context (B).** Cheapest retest: recompute the exact C3 marginal on the same three lineages after replacing the learned context/BASE with an independently certified one. No learner is required.
- **#15 oracle marginals (B).** Cheapest retest: a path-consistent exact-oracle probe on the same cells, but over the intended set-level candidate object and independently certified learned context/BASE. It must not reuse the narrower unilateral proxy that later adjudication said was a different object.
- **#29 coordination-axis outcome plan (C).** Cheapest retest: first repair/certify the reference and then recompute the same bounded ceiling; if the intended claim is global, widen or certify the candidate support before using it to close the route.
- **#30 deadline positioning (C).** Cheapest retest: compare stored checkpoint-safe anytime endpoints at the exact same wall-clock budget to a reference/search implementation certified independently of the suspect learned base; no learner is needed to establish available headroom.

